      {
        "Id": "09c19fb6634d42f9a4e61f464b8dd14f",
        "Title": "HOW TO USE  -  select the walls in the plan, Run\nA grid is placed on the CENTRE of every wall line.  VERTICAL walls -> 1, 2, 3 ... (left to right)   HORIZONTAL walls -> A, B, C ... (bottom to top, no I / O)\nWalls on the same line share one grid.  Grids get bubbles, dash-dot line and ISO grid dimensions in every plan.\nChanged the selection? Switch PLACE / UPDATE GRIDS off and on, then Run (Dynamo only runs again when an input changes).",
        "DescriptionText": null,
